<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" version="2.0"><channel><atom:link href="https://www.aboutamazon.com/rss/feed.rss" type="application/rss+xml" rel="self"/><title>Amazon News</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/amazon-news-today</link><description>Amazon News RSS Feed</description><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 00:57:51 GMT</lastBuildDate><image><title>Amazon News</title><url>https://assets.aboutamazon.com/f2/a4/a07ef04d49df8b93eb283512a0fc/amazon-news-newsletter-beige.png</url><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/amazon-news-today</link></image><item><title>From zero to 1,000: How Amazon Leo built one of the world&apos;s largest satellite production lines</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/stories/how-amazon-leo-builds-satellites?utm_source=rss</link><description>Amazon has built more than 1,000 satellites for its growing constellation—and it&apos;s just getting started.</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 16:01:58 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/stories/how-amazon-leo-builds-satellites</guid><category>Amazon Leo</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/8b8030f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F17%2F4f%2Fe71ce5a9489b96590d7601270f7d%2Fleomanufacturing-inline002-amazon-news-lj-20261007-still.jpg"/></item><item><title>How AWS is helping companies build physical AI machines that think</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/aws/aws-physical-ai-toolchain-build-intelligent-machines?utm_source=rss</link><description>Amazon launched the Physical AI Toolchain on AWS, an open-source stack that helps manufacturers build machines that perceive, reason, and act in the real world.</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 13:00:13 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/aws/aws-physical-ai-toolchain-build-intelligent-machines</guid><category>AWS</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/4fda31b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F2b%2Fe8%2F55307dea410f85c7408920cf8b85%2Fabout-amazon-hero-ai-toolchain-hero-amazon-news-lt-092926.jpg"/></item><item><title>Amazon announces an all-new family of tablets designed just for kids</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/new-amazon-kids-tablets?utm_source=rss</link><description>New Amazon Kids Tablets available in two models for younger and older kids</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 12:55:18 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/new-amazon-kids-tablets</guid><category>Devices</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/7e5cae7/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1126+0+0/resize/767x432!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fb3%2F34%2F9d2f58c54f8ca89c10292d18195d%2Famazon-kidstablets-amazonnews-inline-ck10726.png"/></item><item><title>Introducing all-new Amazon Alexa Tablets—powerful tablets with Alexa+ built in</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/new-amazon-alexa-tablets-alexa-plus?utm_source=rss</link><description>An all-new lineup of tablets with world-class hardware, personalized intelligence from Alexa+, and full Google Play Store access.</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 12:55:12 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/new-amazon-alexa-tablets-alexa-plus</guid><category>Devices</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/b271302/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1600x900+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fad%2Fdc%2Fa7f630ec4671960c964ff943c481%2Famazonalexatablet-inline-amazonnews-ck10826.jpg"/></item><item><title>Amazon in the community: Here’s what’s happening in Seattle, Bellevue, and the Puget Sound</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-seattle-bellevue-puget-sound-news?utm_source=rss</link><description>Learn how we invest in the community, help power the local economy, and support our employees in the Puget Sound region.</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 22:05:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-seattle-bellevue-puget-sound-news</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/fa71e99/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1125x1125+438+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Ff2%2Fe4%2F6f67188e480392ce0b19a6671b59%2Fspheres-rolling-blog-hero-1.jpg"/></item><item><title>&apos;Clarkson&apos;s Farm&apos; special &apos;Jeremy Grows a Car&apos; coming to Prime Video in 2027</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/clarksons-farm-special-jeremy-grows-a-car-prime-video?utm_source=rss</link><description>Jeremy Clarkson is going back to his automotive roots by building his own car using produce from his farm.</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 18:00:06 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/clarksons-farm-special-jeremy-grows-a-car-prime-video</guid><category>Entertainment</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/425729f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Ffc%2F0b%2Fd8dbddfe4281af1346b1235b1d65%2Fjeremy-grows-a-car-clarkson-farm-special-hero-amazon-news.png"/></item><item><title>Ring ends smart lock anxiety with a lock you can recharge by hand</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/ring-smart-lock-battery-recharge?utm_source=rss</link><description> Ring&apos;s first-ever smart lock eliminates the need for a key with a built-in power dial and four ways in.</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 13:55:11 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/ring-smart-lock-battery-recharge</guid><category>Devices</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/9be1cab/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1126+0+0/resize/767x432!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F04%2Fe8%2F467af05c4b43accf78a07e26553a%2Fring-smart-lock-hero-amazonnews-ck10626.jpg"/></item><item><title>Ring introduces four new 4K cameras and a pan-tilt indoor cam</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/ring-4k-cameras-pan-tilt-cam?utm_source=rss</link><description>Ring’s expanded camera lineup gives you more ways to see and protect your home, indoors and out.</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 13:55:09 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/ring-4k-cameras-pan-tilt-cam</guid><category>Devices</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/053e82f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1126+0+0/resize/767x432!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fda%2F01%2F499bedff40f989fc37e1cece41ad%2Ffreya-pr-ring-family-1-2000x1126.jpg"/></item><item><title>Prime Big Deal Days 2026 ends tonight: 200 of the best deals to shop now</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/retail/best-prime-big-deal-days-2026-top-deals?utm_source=rss</link><description>Prime Big Deal Days ends tonight at 11:59 p.m. PDT (2:59 a.m. EDT Thursday). From tech and toys to kitchen, beauty, and fall fashion, here are the top deals to shop before the 48-hour event ends.</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 12:38:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/retail/best-prime-big-deal-days-2026-top-deals</guid><category>Retail</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/bd8ee6c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fdd%2Fa8%2Fb5a8909247d3a271b88551721627%2Fpbdd-2026-best-deals-hero5-amazon-news-lt.gif"/></item><item><title>Amazon data center communities: Here’s what’s happening near data centers across the US</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/aws/amazon-data-centers-locations-news?utm_source=rss</link><description>Get the latest updates on how Amazon supports small businesses, creates jobs, sets up sustainability initiatives, and develops educational programs near AWS data centers.</description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 18:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/aws/amazon-data-centers-locations-news</guid><category>AWS</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/6081627/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2962x2962+1155+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fa3%2Ff6%2F0abb1c1a4734ba2e727893e6eae2%2Faws-data-center-exterior-1.jpg"/></item></channel></rss>